OL,5,G1400 Record Review
OL,6,     FAndrew McGregor with the week's
OL,7,     Fbest new classical releases,
OL,8,     Fjoined by Sarah Lenton and Joseph
OL,9,     FMcHardy, who surveys recordings of
OL,10,     FBach's Cello Suites and makes a
OL,11,     Ftop recommendation.
OL,12,G1600 Sound of Cinema
OL,13,     FYour weekly guide to the best
OL,14,     Fmovie soundtracks with Edith
OL,15,     FBowman. Jess Gillam reveals her
OL,16,     FPick of the Flicks, and Harry
OL,17,     FEscott presents this week's
OL,18,     FHarmonising Hollywood.
